As a late-game Monk, you should probably be using attack
spells for some of your killing, especially when multiple
enemies are lined up so that you can hit several for the
price of one.  The Sanctum (particularly before you pick up
the Amulet) is pretty much a textbook example of a scenario
where spellcasting gets you more bang for your buck than
melee.

